  "description": "Random-access (seekable) reading of gzip (DEFLATE) streams: builds a verified zran-style checkpoint index (32 KiB window + bit offset per point) and serves a standard seekable Stream over the data. Handles multi-member gzip. Self-contained managed code; no native binaries.",
